    - target: {fileID: 5987603906880096048, guid: cfb77f6ed65a95c46ac4bc57a2533e11, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<B>Instruction</B>\n\nControllers:\n  1. On the right or left controller
        \u2013 Aim and press the Grip Button to pull the model closer.\n  2. On the
        right or left controller \u2013 Grab object by holding Grip Button.\n  3.
        On the right or left controller \u2013 Press the Trigger Button on an annotation
        to view its description.\n  4. On the right or left controller \u2013 Press
        the Trigger Button on the speaker icon for voice output.\n  5. Using both
        controllers \u2013 Press the Grip Buttons simultaneously to scale the model.\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
